1
00:00:00,298 --> 00:00:02,298
(Jimmy:)What apology?

2
00:00:02,509 --> 00:00:05,469
(Leonard:)For all the crappy stuff you did to me
in high school.

3
00:00:05,679 --> 00:00:09,019
Oh, jeez, you're still harping on that?
What a puss.

4
00:00:10,350 --> 00:00:13,480
- That's my French toast.
- It's good.

5
00:00:13,895 --> 00:00:16,815
(Jimmy:)You really know your way
around a kitchen, Nancy.

6
00:00:18,483 --> 00:00:22,653
(Sheldon:)I'm not going to say I told you so,
but we could've killed him.

7
00:00:25,615 --> 00:00:27,285
(Leonard:)I might kill him right now.

8
00:00:27,492 --> 00:00:29,702
(Sheldon:)The Dark Knight has your back.

9
00:00:29,911 --> 00:00:32,501
(Sheldon:)He's scared, but he has your back.

10
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:34,750
Hey, Jimmy, it's time for you to go.

11
00:00:34,958 --> 00:00:37,298
- Yeah, let me just finish this.
- No. You're done.

12
00:00:37,502 --> 00:00:41,252
- I want you out of my apartment now.
- Well said, Boy Wonder.

13
00:00:43,508 --> 00:00:45,048
(Jimmy:)Or what?

14
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:48,470
Don't answer. That's a trick question.
I speak from experience.

15
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,810
I'm not afraid of you anymore, Jimmy.

16
00:00:54,019 --> 00:00:55,899
(Leonard:)Now, get out.

17
00:00:56,605 --> 00:00:58,145
(Leonard:)Uh-oh.

18
00:00:59,733 --> 00:01:01,693
(Sheldon:)You did it.
You stood up to your bully.

